+---
+id: task-001-fix-order-sku-free-shipping-and-vat-rounding-reports
+type: task
+title: "Fix order SKU, free shipping, and VAT rounding reports"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Resolve three reported order-service defects:
+
+1. Product lookup must accept SKUs entered in lowercase, consistent with the documented
+   case-insensitive SKU rule.
+2. Shipping must be free when the discounted goods total is exactly €50.00, consistent with the
+   documented threshold.
+3. Standard-rate VAT on a single €1.99 line must round half up to €0.44, consistent with the
+   documented per-line VAT rule.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- A product can be ordered using a lowercase SKU, and the service presents the canonical uppercase
+  SKU.
+- An order whose post-discount goods amount is €50.00 has no shipping charge.
+- A €1.99 standard-rate line has €0.44 VAT.
+- Existing order, shipping, and tax behavior remains covered by the repository's tests.
